 "sampling_rule": "select_jobs.py (fixed before the nonce was drawn): for each source run, enumerate its job list as n2_routes.rs main builds it for the recorded command; score each job by sha256('<nonce>|<run-dir>|<job-id>') ascending; select jobs of distinct sizes in score order up to the run's quota (itemOJ 3, itemF 2, H1 3, H2 3, H4 2, H6 1), a second pass admitting new cells if a run has fewer sizes than its quota. The replay unit is the smallest cell the tool can be restricted to by env (N2_SIZES, N2_HS, N2_CS), so every row of the selected job's cell is replayed and compared, and the selected job's own rows are reported separately. Supplementary cells (validator-chosen, NOT nonce-drawn, flagged nonce_drawn=false) extend coverage to every remaining recorded cell; they do not replace the nonce sample.",
