  "rule": "every replayed CSV row equals a recorded row of the same cell in every column except a trailing wall-clock `seconds` column (control.csv has none and is compared on all columns); multiset equality per cell; each dump line is tied 1:1 to its replayed row by (bits, [h], instance, target, arm[, theta]) with equal p, ell, N and verified == (k_found == k)",
