   "1 <= k < ell",
   "k_found*P = Q",
   "k_found == k"
  ],
  "negative_controls": "one real 44-bit dump line mutated 7 ways (k_found+1, k changed, Q negated, P off-curve, ell+2, N+2, N outside Hasse): each fails the expected checks, exit 1",
